# Security Policy

## Reporting a vulnerability
Please *do not open a public issue* for security problems in Project Omega.
Use GitHub's private reporting: *Security → Report a vulnerability* on this repository.
Include the command you ran, the Omega version (--version), your Python version, and steps to reproduce.
You can expect an acknowledgement within 7 days.

## Supported versions
| Version | Supported |
|---|---|
| 5.x | Yes |
| < 5 | No |

## Responsible use
Omega is for defensive use on systems you own or are authorised to test. Reports about misuse of the tool against third parties are not vulnerabilities in Omega.
